ading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Freezing_Icon_Big_4dcec8.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.0000\" title=\"Fire\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Fire <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Burning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burning_Icon_Big_a56686.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.2000\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">120%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:83.3333%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 16.6667%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:83.3333%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 16.6667%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:83.3333%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 16.6667%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Glacier\">Formorgar Glacier</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Mines\">Formorgar Mines</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor%20Ice%20Cave\">Nibelor Ice Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Witch%20Temple\">Ice Witch Temple</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Deeper%20Banuta\">Deeper Banuta</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Crystal%20Caves\">Crystal Caves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThey move slowly and are easy to outrun, but will deal a lot of damage if they catch you.<br/><br/>An ice golem attacks in melee range. An ice golem never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tThanks to their focus on energy spells, <b>Sorcerers</b> will find ice golems rather enjoyable to hunt. Because mages do not need Frosty Hearts for <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">imbuing</a>, they can sell them all for a significant profit. Most of the time sorcerers should just use an energy wand and cast <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Strike\">Energy Strike</a>. If you find yourself in a tight spot, <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Energy%20Beam\">Great Energy Beam</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wave\">Energy Wave</a> are extremely effective for fast kills.<br/>\n</p><p><b><a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druids</a></b> are slightly less effective against ice golems, since they have access to only one energy spell. However, earth spells still deal full damage, so you will not have any problems. Use an earth rod and cast <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Strike\">Energy Strike</a>. Terra Wave will be helpful for emergencies.<br/>\n</p><p>All mages would do well to bring some <a href=\"#/wiki/Thunderstorm%20Rune\">Thunderstorm Runes</a> in case they run into two or three ice golems at once.\n<br/>\n</p><p>Ice golems are not very <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a></b>-friendly monsters. Even though they do not have a lot of health, their defence alone is very strong, they possess some <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">physical damage</a> resistance on top of that, they hit very hard in close range and reduce melee and shield skills quite often. In general, it is not advised to hunt ice golems as a knight. However, if you are level 60+, have a Scrapper-level weapon and good skills (at least 80/80), the tasks are doable and profitable. Try to fight one at a time and be extremely careful when facing two or three at once, as they can send you back to the temple in the blink of an eye.<br/>\n</p><p>Due to their focus on <a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\">physical damage</a>, <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a></b> face similar issues as knights, as the task is usually completed at around level 50-60 and it is not until a higher level that a paladin's damage output will far exceed that of a knight. Still, as long-range fighters, in most situations paladins should only take damage from the icicle attacks. Holy spells are completely useless against ice golems, so use Ethereal Spear to kill them faster. You should use at least <a href=\"#/wiki/Onyx%20Arrow\">onyx arrows</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Bolt\">power bolts</a> for a reasonable kill speed, but you can wait until level 70 for a significant damage boost from envenomed arrows or drill bolts. Remember to stay diagonal while running, in order to avoid the paralyzing beam.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 66,108 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-containe